+	.string "POKéMON in JOHTO.\p"
+	.string "Please visit his lab in NEW BARK\n"
+	.string "TOWN. He could use your help.\p"
+	.string "I've sent him word of your visit.\n"
+	.string "Return to INDIGO PLATEAU.\p"
+	.string "Take the road west of the LEAGUE\n"
+	.string "down to the coast on ROUTE 27.\p"
+	.string "SURF west to NEW BARK TOWN.\n"
+	.string "ELM's lab is in the northwest.\p"
+	.string "You and your POKéMON have so much\n"
+	.string "more to discover together!$"
+
+PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_JohtoEncouragement::
+	.string "OAK: How are your travels in JOHTO?\p"
+	.string "Keep helping PROF.ELM, and take on\n"
+	.string "the GYMS and POKéMON LEAGUE there.\p"
+	.string "I'm looking forward to hearing\n"
+	.string "about your discoveries!$"
+
+PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_JohtoPostgame::
+	.string "OAK: Wonderful, {PLAYER}!\p"
+	.string "You've earned all eight BADGES\n"
+	.string "and become CHAMPION in both\l"
+	.string "KANTO and JOHTO.\p"
+	.string "I've arranged access to MT.SILVER\n"
+	.string "through the RECEPTION GATE.\p"
+	.string "Strong wild POKéMON live there.\n"
+	.string "Take care of yourself and your team!$"
+
+PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_JohtoPass::
+	.string "That PASS lets you take the\n"
+	.string "MAGNET TRAIN between GOLDENROD\l"
+	.string "and SAFFRON.\p"
+	.string "Keep in touch with PROF.ELM\n"
+	.string "and me wherever you travel!$"
+
+PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_JohtoPostgameReady::
+	.string "Your route to MT.SILVER is open,\n"
+	.string "and your MAGNET TRAIN PASS is ready.\p"
+	.string "Keep recording your discoveries\n"
+	.string "in the POKéDEX!$"
+
+PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_JohtoPassBagFull::
+	.string "I've kept a MAGNET TRAIN PASS\n"
+	.string "for you, but your BAG is full.\p"
+	.string "Make room and talk to me again.\n"
+	.string "Your MT.SILVER access is already\l"
+	.string "arranged.$"
+#endif
